# REQUIRES: verilator
# --slot-segments K: a slot table of more than 64 rows whose nonzero rows are
# at most K affine segments (position s + j*ds holding v + j*dv, ds and dv
# powers of two) is a decoder of its index instead of a constant array, so
# its size does not grow with the frame or the instances. The frames here are
# padded past 64 positions (--min-ii 160), so every table of the frame is one.
# Against the target, exact: virtual memories at any response latency with
# stalled channels, nested sequencers with bubbles, a short lead with copies;
# HBM link streams on shared page engines (paged classes, nested, bubbles).
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t && cd %S/../Driver/Inputs/vmem
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/a --static --modulo --min-ii 160 --virtual-memories ram --slot-segments 8 Leaf > %t/a.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=LOG < %t/a.log
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=SIM < %t/a/foldsim_sim.mlir
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --top-module tb -Mdir %t/a/obj %S/Inputs/tb_vmem.sv top.sv %t/a/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/a/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/a/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+1 +lo=1 +hi=30 +stall=20 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/b --static --modulo --min-ii 160 --virtual-memories ram --nest --bubbles --slot-segments 8 Leaf > %t/b.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=LOG < %t/b.log
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --top-module tb -DBUBBLES -Mdir %t/b/obj %S/Inputs/tb_vmem.sv top.sv %t/b/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/b/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/b/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+2 +lo=1 +hi=30 +bubble=60 +burst=8 +stall=10 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/c --static --modulo --min-ii 160 --virtual-memories ram --short-lead --copies Leaf:2 --slot-segments 8 Leaf > %t/c.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=LOG < %t/c.log
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --top-module tb -DCOPIES2 -DIW=1 -Mdir %t/c/obj %S/Inputs/tb_vmem.sv top.sv %t/c/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/c/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/c/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+3 +lo=1 +hi=40 +stall=30 +full=10 | FileCheck %s
# LOG: foldsim-fold-static: II = 160
# LOG: foldsim-fold-static: slot-sequencer: {{[1-9][0-9]*}} tables decoded ({{.*}}), 0 tables kept
# SIM-NOT: hw.aggregate_constant {{.*}}!hw.array<256x
# CHECK-NOT: PROTOCOL
# CHECK: {{^}}MATCH
# HBM link streams on shared page engines, paged classes (pages of 4: a page
# of 3 puts the passes 3 apart, which a segment does not decode), nested
# sequencers and bubbles (Inputs/linkshare, as static-link-hbm-shift.test).
# RUN: cd %S/../Driver/Inputs/linkshare
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/hbm --static --nest --modulo --bubbles --min-ii 160 --page Unit:4,Vnit:4,Reader:4,Sink:4 --page-engines auto --link-hbm-shift 8 --link-kinds Unit:Reader:hbm,Vnit:Reader:hbm,Unit:Sink:hbm --slot-segments 8 Unit Vnit Reader Sink > %t/hbm.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=LOG < %t/hbm.log
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --x-initial unique --top-module tb -I%t/hbm -DBUBBLES -Mdir %t/hbm/obj %S/Inputs/tb_linkhbm.sv top.sv %t/hbm/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/hbm/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/hbm/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+2 +verilator+seed+6 +lo=1 +hi=30 +bubble=30 +stall=30 +full=20 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=HBM
# RUN: %t/hbm/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+2 +verilator+seed+5 +lo=40 +hi=60 +full=40 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=HBM
# HBM-NOT: PROTOCOL
# HBM: {{^}}MATCH
# --affine-slots: each copy's passes of a kind placed as one run over its
# instances (o + k*P); exact, its tables decoded (vmem, nested, bubbles).
# RUN: cd %S/../Driver/Inputs/vmem
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/aff --static --modulo --min-ii 160 --virtual-memories ram --nest --bubbles --copies Leaf:2 --affine-slots --slot-segments 8 Leaf > %t/aff.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=LOG < %t/aff.log
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --top-module tb -DBUBBLES -DCOPIES2 -DIW=1 -Mdir %t/aff/obj %S/Inputs/tb_vmem.sv top.sv %t/aff/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/aff/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/aff/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+9 +lo=1 +hi=40 +bubble=60 +burst=8 +stall=20 +full=20 | FileCheck %s
# Negative: a table needing more segments than K (here K = 1) stays a
# constant, counted, and the simulator stays exact. (One copy: with Leaf:2 the
# table that needed two segments was a lookahead register's hold table, which
# the register's own value now replaces.)
# RUN: cd %S/../Driver/Inputs/vmem
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/neg --static --modulo --min-ii 160 --virtual-memories ram --slot-segments 1 Leaf > %t/neg.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=NEG < %t/neg.log
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --top-module tb -Mdir %t/neg/obj %S/Inputs/tb_vmem.sv top.sv %t/neg/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/neg/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/neg/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+11 +lo=1 +hi=40 +stall=20 | FileCheck %s
# NEG: foldsim-fold-static: slot-sequencer: {{[0-9]+}} tables decoded ({{.*}}), {{[1-9][0-9]*}} tables kept
# --affine-auto (bits 0, K 1): a class whose slot rows do not decode within
# K is placed affine and the frame scheduled again (lanes_late: Leaf, with
# bubbles and ready lanes); exact. Where no frame places it affine (tree-arb:
# the slice tree's levels in one class), it is scheduled as before; exact.
# RUN: cd %S/../Driver/Inputs/lanes_late
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/auto --static --nest --modulo --min-ii 100 --bubbles --csf-ready-copies Leaf:2 --csf-ready-cones --slot-segments 1 --affine-auto --affine-auto-bits 0 Leaf > %t/auto.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=AUTO < %t/auto.log
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --x-initial unique --top-module tb -DBUBBLES -Mdir %t/auto/obj %S/Inputs/tb_late.sv top.sv %t/auto/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/auto/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/auto/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+12 +stall=20 +bubble=40 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=LATE
# RUN: cd %S/../Driver/Inputs/tree-arb
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/back --static --no-drop-dead-inputs --no-staged-link-direct --nest --modulo --min-ii 100 --compact-links --staged-links --share-links --zero-latency-links --zero-latency-chains --class-at 'sl@*.slice' --class-at 'root@inner:arb' --slot-segments 2 --affine-auto --affine-auto-bits 0 > %t/back.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=BACK < %t/back.log
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --x-initial unique --top-module tb -Mdir %t/back/obj %S/Inputs/tb_reset.sv top.sv %t/back/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/back/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/back/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+2 +verilator+seed+3 +stall=60 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=LATE
# AUTO: foldsim-fold-static: affine-auto: round 1: II {{[0-9]+}}, 1 more classes affine (Leaf)
# AUTO-NOT: no frame places
# BACK: foldsim-fold-static: affine-auto: no frame places sl affine; scheduled as before
